      #|  !(h:real->complex) u n FF F'.\n     schwartz h /\\ real_measurable FF /\\ measurable F' /\\ F' SUBSET (IMAGE lift\n       FF)\n     ==> ((\\K. vsum {j:num | j <= n}\n                (\\j. vsum {k:int | abs k <= &K}\n                  (\\k. Cx(&2 * pi) * integral (F' INTER {x:real^1 | cargmax\n                    (\\i:num. carleson_v h (u i)) n (drop x) = j})\n                       (\\x. fourier (\\y. fourier h y * Cx(carleson_psi (u j) k\n                         y)) (--drop x)))))\n          --> integral F' (\\x:real^1. carleson_wsel h u n (drop x)))\n         sequentially
